# v1.4.0:
- Add Largest Nations category: improve relations with the largest nations in your diplomatic range, starting with the biggest
- Add Maximum Relations and Maximum Antagonism limits (Improve Relations tab): stop improving a country once its opinion of you reaches the maximum, cancelling any improvement in progress, and skip countries whose antagonism towards you is above the maximum
- Add Block/Allow Autonomous Improving diplomatic actions to stop or resume auto-improving relations with a specific country
- Now Ironman and Achievement compatible
- Outraged Countries: only target nations with at least 10 antagonism, and auto-cancel the improve once their antagonism drops below 5
- Fix auto-improve not picking the next valid country when the highest-priority targets are ineligible
- Fix automation not resuming in some cases after loading a save
- Update for game version 1.3.10

# v1.3.1:
- Update for game version 1.3.6

# v1.3.0:
- Add Market Owners category: improve relations with countries that own a market
- Add Kingdoms and Empires category: improve relations with kingdoms and empires
- Add HRE Imperial Circle Leaders category: improve relations with the leaders of Imperial Circles in the Holy Roman Empire
- Fix automations not working in some cases when loading a save game

# v1.2.4:
- Skip nations you are at war with when improving relations.
- Prevent immediately retargeting a nation after an improve ends without reaching the +200 cap (1-year cooldown)

# v1.2.3:
- Update for game version 1.3
- Integrated with the game's new automation panel
- The Improve Opinion checkbox on the Diplomacy Interactions card now toggles this mod's improve relations (new toggle, also in the Improve Relations tab)
- The Diplomacy Interactions automation toggle now also enables or disables Autonomous Diplomats (new Enabled toggle, also in the Settings tab)
- The Open Diplomatic Actions buttons on the Diplomacy Interactions card open the Autonomous Diplomats settings instead
- Minimum Diplomats Reserve is now shared with the card's Minimum Monthly Diplomats slider and can be changed from either place
- Reserve settings are now sliders
- The game's built-in Improve Opinion automation stays off while the mod is loaded so the two never overlap

# v1.2.2:
- Prevent immediately retargeting the same nation after auto-cancelling (4-year cooldown)

# v1.2.1:
- Update for game version 1.2.5

# v1.2:
- Update for game version 1.2+
- New way of tracking relations progress, so it is now able to keep in sync even when manually cancelling a improve.
- Will now auto-cancel when improving once the target opinion reaches 200.
- Known Issue: Some diplomatic action will not auto-confirm even when you manually do them.

# v1.1:
- New: Enforce Religion automation -- automatically enforce your state religion on eligible subjects
- New: Enforce Culture automation -- automatically enforce your primary culture on eligible subjects
- New: HRE Electors improve relations category -- send diplomats to improve relations with HRE electors
- New: HRE Members improve relations category -- send diplomats to improve relations with fellow HRE members
- HRE categories are only visible when your capital is in Europe and you are an HRE member
- Reorganized settings into 3 tabs: Improve Relations, Subjects, and Settings

# v1.0:
- Initial release
- Automatic diplomat dispatch on a monthly tick for human-controlled countries
- 5 target categories: Neighboring Countries, Own Subjects, Outraged Countries, Allies, Threatening Countries
- Drag-to-reorder priority list via Community Mod Menu
- Per-category diplomat limit sliders (0-10)
- Diplomat reserve settings: minimum free diplomats and minimum monthly diplomat gain
- Progress tracking per target country with natural decay
- Skips countries already at +90 improved relations
- Full DeepL-translated localization for 10 languages
